  "story": {
    "title": "Tickling Tara",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Digging her feet into the warm sand, Tara held a sketchbook in her hand.",
      "She’d watch fishermen come and go She’d sketch the tides, high and low.",
      "Little did she know what lay in store. She found something washed up the shore.",
      "What have they fished? Oh! It is what Tara once wished!",
      "A turtle for a pet? Tara quickly freed it from the net.",
      "The waves carried it and Tara too, How and why, no one knew.",
      "Could it be magic? Was it some kind of a trick?",
      "There was Tara swimming happily Among the creatures of the sea,",
      "Until a droplet touched her nose. In bed was Tara, wiggling her toes.",
      "In the morning, Tara’s eyes did gleam As she raced to the spot from her dream.",
      "\"I wish my dream comes true.” Tara sat by the sea and drew.",
      "By sunset, her drawing was complete Just as she felt ticklish in her feet.",
      "She saw many creatures hurtle And upon her feet was a giant turtle.",
      "Tara was as happy as one could be And soon her friends made a colony.",
      "To this day, she can see them in the night. Stars come together, her friends say goodnight."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Digging her feet into the warm sand, Tara held a sketchbook in her hand.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tara vùi chân vào cát ấm, tay cầm một cuốn sổ vẽ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She’d watch fishermen come and go She’d sketch the tides, high and low.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thường ngắm ngư dân đi lại. Cô bé cũng vẽ thủy triều lúc lên, lúc xuống."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Little did she know what lay in store.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé không hề biết điều gì đang chờ đợi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She found something washed up the shore.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm thấy một thứ trôi dạt vào bờ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What have they fished?",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Họ đã câu được gì vậy?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh! It is what Tara once wished!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ôi! Đó chính là điều Tara từng ước!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A turtle for a pet?",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một chú rùa làm thú cưng ư?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tara quickly freed it from the net.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tara nhanh chóng giải thoát nó khỏi tấm lưới."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The waves carried it and Tara too, How and why, no one knew.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những con sóng cuốn nó đi, và cả Tara nữa. Không ai biết tại sao và bằng cách nào."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Could it be magic?",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có phải là phép thuật không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Was it some kind of a trick?",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hay là một trò lừa nào đó?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There was Tara swimming happily Among the creatures of the sea,",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tara đang bơi lội vui vẻ giữa các sinh vật biển."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Until a droplet touched her nose.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cho đến khi một giọt nước chạm vào mũi cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In bed was Tara, wiggling her toes.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tara đang ở trên giường, ngọ nguậy các ngón chân."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the morning, Tara’s eyes did gleam As she raced to the spot from her dream.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sáng hôm sau, mắt Tara sáng lên khi cô bé chạy đến chỗ trong giấc mơ của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I wish my dream comes true.” Tara sat by the sea and drew.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Con ước mơ của con thành hiện thực.\" Tara ngồi bên bờ biển và vẽ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "By sunset, her drawing was complete Just as she felt ticklish in her feet.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đến lúc hoàng hôn, bức vẽ của cô bé đã hoàn thành, đúng lúc cô bé cảm thấy nhột ở chân."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She saw many creatures hurtle And upon her feet was a giant turtle.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thấy nhiều sinh vật lao tới, và trên chân cô bé là một chú rùa khổng lồ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tara was as happy as one could be And soon her friends made a colony.",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tara vui sướng vô cùng, và chẳng mấy chốc bạn bè của cô bé đã tạo thành một đàn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "To this day, she can see them in the night.",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cho đến tận bây giờ, cô bé vẫn có thể nhìn thấy chúng vào ban đêm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Stars come together, her friends say goodnight.",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12163/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những ngôi sao tụ lại, bạn bè cô bé nói lời chúc ngủ ngon."
      }
    ]
  },
